istinct.\nA vehicle, route, driver roster, accessibility lift, traffic plan, or candidate facility map change makes earlier transit evidence stale.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nSHELTER arrival planning consumes TRANSIT capacity, LABOR supplies drivers, and COMMS publishes only confirmed routes.\nCLIMATE changes geographic staging and LINEAGE binds the route map to the current candidate.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| TRN-000 | route-red | v3 | 88.0 | percent-available | superseded |\n| TRN-001 | route-blue | v3 | 89.7 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-002 | paratransit | v3 | 88.5 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-003 | shuttle-reserve | v3 | 90.2 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-004 | route-red | v3 | 89.0 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-005 | route-blue | v3 | 90.7 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-006 | paratransit | v3 | 89.5 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-007 | shuttle-reserve | v3 | 88.3 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-008 | route-red | v3 | 90.0 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-009 | route-blue | v3 | 88.8 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-010 | paratransit | v3 | 90.5 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-011 | shuttle-reserve | v3 | 89.3 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-012 | route-red | v3 | 88.1 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-013 | route-blue | v4 | 89.8 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-014 | paratransit | v4 | 88.6 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-015 | shuttle-reserve | v4 | 90.3 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-016 | route-red | v4 | 89.1 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-017 | route-blue | v4 | 90.8 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-018 | paratransit | v4 | 89.6 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-019 | shuttle-reserve | v4 | 88.4 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-020 | route-red | v4 | 90.1 | percent-available | current |\n| TRN-021 | route-blue | v4 | 88